Alembic database migrations for Aurea v2.

Run from the backend/ directory with the virtual environment active.

Common commands
---------------

Apply all pending migrations (local SQLite or production PostgreSQL):
    python -m alembic upgrade head

Roll back the last migration:
    python -m alembic downgrade -1

Show current revision:
    python -m alembic current

Show migration history:
    python -m alembic history --verbose

Auto-generate a new migration after changing a model:
    python -m alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe your change"

Always review auto-generated migrations before applying them.
